    "description": "Hungry Howie\u2019s is the Original Flavored Crust Pizza\u2122. With 8 great Flavored Crust\u2122 pizzas and a wide selection of toppings, we have a pizza to please almost anyone. \r\n\r\nIn addition to our mouth-watering Original Flavored Crust Pizza\u2122, we have plenty of other menu items like Howie Bread, Howie Wings, Oven Baked Subs, Crisp & Cool Salads, and more. \r\n\r\nWe\u2019ll make it FAST, We\u2019ll make it FRESH, and We\u2019ll make it just FOR YOU!\r\n\r\nBy downloading this application from the Google Play Store you will be automatically opted into push notifications. To modify or turn off notifications please change these settings within your specific device settings.",
